This repository is a fork of Neroued/ninfer <https://github.com/Neroued/ninfer>, the upstream
project created by Neroued. Both are licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

Relative to that upstream project this fork adds the dual-GPU TP-2 execution route for a pair of
GeForce RTX 5060 Ti cards, the native Windows build, serving and packaging scripts, and the TP-2
documentation, and it changes the engine, serving and model code those routes touch. No file
carries a per-file change notice; the difference from upstream is this fork's commit history, and
the affected areas are named in README.md under "Relationship to upstream".

